# [DD-13b.W23.1] AN INDENTED `#` INSIDE A PROSE REGION IS PROSE.
# r57 grammar-lens PROBE CELL, and §1.6.1a candidate (2): a narrowing
# AVOIDED rather than one taken, which is what this fixture PINS. Inside
# an S3 opaque region S0 does not run for dispatch or attachment, so the
# `#` is bytes like every other byte there; OUTSIDE a region an indented
# `#` is still the structure error it has always been
# (indented_comment_in_config.rxtin is that half). A later wave that
# weakens S3 would re-create the narrowing silently, and this cell is
# what makes it loud.
description |
  first prose line
  # this is prose, not a comment
  third prose line

pattern a+
m "aaa" 0 3
